5. **Evidence and remediation** — analyze/harness steps, CSS link guidance, `build-showcase.py`, escalation to related rules.
6. **Related rules** — `DET.APP.PRIMITIVE_MARKERS`, `DET.APP.PRIMITIVE_SOURCE`, `DET.APP.SHELL_INTEGRATION`, `DET.APP.CONTROL_A11Y`, `AI.APP.PRIMITIVE_CONSISTENCY`.

